Package: plantbreeding
Type: Package
Title: Analysis and Visualization of Data from Plant Breeding and Genetics Experiments
Version: 2.0.0
Date: 2026-05-08
Author: Umesh R. Rosyara 
Maintainer: Umesh R. Rosyara <rosyaraur@gmail.com>
Depends: 
    R (>= 4.0.0)
Imports: 
        ggplot2,
        agricolae,
        multcomp,
        lmPerm, 
        dplyr
Suggests: 
    qtl, 
    onemap,
    gstat,
    sp,
    lmPerm,
    multcomp,
    randomForest
Description: The package contains comprehensive functionalities relevant to the analysis of data from conventional and molecular plant breeding and genetics experiments. Features include multi-environment trial (MET) analysis, spatial experimental designs, mixed models (BLUEs/BLUPs), genomic relationship matrices, and interactive data visualization.
License: GPL (>= 2)
URL: https://r-forge.r-project.org/projects/plantbreeding/
